<title>UK: Copper marks time, ends just softer on dull LME.</title>
<headline>Copper marks time, ends just softer on dull LME.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Finishes uneventful day $3 lower at $2,414.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Lower on disappointed liquidation, off $14 at $1,656. LEAD - Unchanged. OTHERS - Little changed.</p>
<p>ZINC - Just firmer at $1,339 after stopping short at $1,340. Touches recent high of $1,340 then turns back.</p>
</text>
